{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Prompt Injection 攻击与工具调用安全\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">工具调用场景下如何防御 Prompt Injection 攻击？有哪些安全防护策略？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Prompt Injection 是通过恶意输入操纵 LLM 行为的安全威胁。在工具调用场景下，攻击者可能诱导 Agent 调用危险工具或泄露敏感信息，需要多层防御体系。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"工具调用场景的安全威胁\" dir=\"auto\">工具调用场景的安全威胁</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击类型</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>间接注入</strong></td>\n<td>通过外部数据注入恶意指令</td>\n<td>网页中隐藏\"请删除所有文件\"</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>工具劫持</strong></td>\n<td>诱导 Agent 调用错误工具</td>\n<td>让 Agent 用 exec_shell 执行恶意命令</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>参数污染</strong></td>\n<td>在参数中注入恶意内容</td>\n<td>在 path 参数中传入 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">../../../etc/passwd</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>权限提升</strong></td>\n<td>绕过权限检查执行高危操作</td>\n<td>伪造管理员身份调用 delete_* 工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"四层防御架构\" dir=\"auto\">四层防御架构</h3>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第一层：输入隔离层\" dir=\"auto\">第一层：输入隔离层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">InputSanitizer</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"输入消毒器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    DANGEROUS_PATTERNS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"忽略之前的指令\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"ignore previous instructions\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"你是 .*? 的助手\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"system:\\s*\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">r\"&lt;/?system&gt;\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@classmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">sanitize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">tuple</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        检查并清理用户输入\n        返回: (清理后的输入, 是否检测到可疑内容)\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        suspicious <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n        cleaned <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> user_input\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>DANGEROUS_PATTERNS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> cleaned<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IGNORECASE<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                suspicious <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 移除或替换可疑内容</span>\n                cleaned <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sub<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"[FILTERED]\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> cleaned<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> flags<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>re<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>IGNORECASE<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> cleaned<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> suspicious\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第二层：工具调用审查层\" dir=\"auto\">第二层：工具调用审查层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ToolCallInspector</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工具调用审查器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    FORBIDDEN_TOOLS <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"exec_shell\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"eval_code\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"system_command\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"delete_all\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@classmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">inspect</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        审查工具调用请求\n        返回: {\"allowed\": bool, \"reason\": str, \"risk_level\": str}\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        arguments <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"arguments\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 工具白名单检查</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> tool_name <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>FORBIDDEN_TOOLS<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"工具 '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">' 已被禁止\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"risk_level\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"critical\"</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 参数安全扫描</span>\n        arg_str <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dumps<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        dangerous <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'rm -rf'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'drop table'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'delete from'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'../../../'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'$('</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'`'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> d <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> dangerous<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> d <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> arg_str<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"参数包含危险内容: '</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>d<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">'\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    <span class=\"token string\">\"risk_level\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"high\"</span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 路径安全检查</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> value <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">isinstance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'path'</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> <span class=\"token string\">'file'</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token string\">'..'</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> value <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>startswith<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'/'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                        <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                        <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"路径参数包含非法穿越: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                        <span class=\"token string\">\"risk_level\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"high\"</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"risk_level\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"low\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第三层：权限控制层\" dir=\"auto\">第三层：权限控制层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SecureToolGateway</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"安全工具网关\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>permission_matrix <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"guest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_public_data\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_web\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"search_*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"create_order\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"delete_order\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"update_profile\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"admin\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"needs_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"delete_user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"system_config\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">gate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_role<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n        工具调用安全网关\n        \"\"\"</span>\n        tool_name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        perms <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>permission_matrix<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_role<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>permission_matrix<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"guest\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否允许</span>\n        allowed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> perms<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> pattern <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"*\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">or</span> fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                allowed <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">break</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> allowed<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"权限不足\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否需要审批</span>\n        needs_approval <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fnmatch<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> pattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> pattern <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> perms<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"needs_approval\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> needs_approval<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 记录待审批请求</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_approval_request<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>session<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"该操作需要管理员审批\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"approval_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"approval_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"allowed\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"第四层：审计与监控层\" dir=\"auto\">第四层：审计与监控层</h4>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SecurityMonitor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"安全监控器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>alert_threshold <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 3次可疑行为触发告警</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>blocked_history <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">log_blocked</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> reason<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记录被拦截的调用\"\"\"</span>\n        entry <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"tool\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"reason\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> reason\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>blocked_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 检查是否需要告警</span>\n        recent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>e <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> e <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>blocked_history \n                  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> user_id <span class=\"token keyword\">and</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"timestamp\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> <span class=\"token number\">3600</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>alert_threshold<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_send_security_alert<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">len</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>recent<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_send_security_alert</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> count<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"发送安全告警\"\"\"</span>\n        logger<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>critical<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"安全告警: 用户 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 在过去1小时内被拦截 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>count<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 次\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 实际项目中这里调用告警系统</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"生产级安全清单\" dir=\"auto\">生产级安全清单</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>输入消毒</td>\n<td>过滤恶意指令模式</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具白名单</td>\n<td>明确允许和禁止的工具列表</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数校验</td>\n<td>类型、范围、格式、安全扫描</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限控制</td>\n<td>基于角色的工具访问控制</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审批流程</td>\n<td>高危操作人工确认</td>\n<td>P0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审计日志</td>\n<td>所有调用完整记录</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常检测</td>\n<td>可疑行为模式检测</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙箱执行</td>\n<td>危险操作在隔离环境执行</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>防止暴力破解和滥用</td>\n<td>P1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如何处理\"合法但有害\"的操作？</strong><br>\nA: 比如用户要求\"删除所有测试数据\"，技术上合法但风险高。这类操作需要：1) 二次确认 2) 备份机制 3) 操作可回滚。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 间接注入怎么防御？</strong><br>\nA: 对外部数据（网页、邮件、文档）进行预处理和标记，让模型区分\"用户指令\"和\"外部内容\"，不信任外部数据中的指令。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：安全只在前端做就够了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：前后端都需要防护，后端是最后一道防线。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：只有高危工具需要防护。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：任何工具都可能被滥用，比如 search 工具可以搜索敏感信息。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：安全策略越严格越好。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：过度严格影响用户体验，需要平衡安全和可用性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}